(42, 'helnovexaa@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, 'Notice for Verification of High-Value Inward Remittance under FEMA Regulations – Account of Prakashraj sesmalji jain', '<p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 1rem;\">Ref No: RBI/FEMA/COMP/RBSCH6-7/2980/2/2026</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 1rem;\">To&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 1rem;\">The Board of Directors / Compliance Officer,</span></p><p>Deccan Finance</p><p class=\"\">Nungambakkam, Chennai – 600006, Tamil Nadu, India.</p><p>Subject: <b>Notice for Verification of High-Value Inward Remittance under FEMA Regulations – Account of Prakashraj sesmalji jain&nbsp;</b></p><p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p><p>It has come to the attention of the Foreign Exchange Management Act (FEMA) Department that a high-value foreign/external transaction (Inward Remittance) has been recently credited into an account maintained with your Non-Banking Financial Company (NBFC). The details of the account and the beneficiary are provided below:</p><p>Account Holder Name: Prakashraj sesmalji jain&nbsp;</p><p>Transaction Reference No:&nbsp;RBFMDEC7383737DFJ868</p><p>Amount/Currency: ₹ 2,50,00,00,000/-</p><p>Rupees Two Hundred and Fifty Crore Only.</p><p>Under the statutory provisions of the Foreign Exchange Management Act (FEMA), 1999, and the prevailing Know Your Customer (KYC)&nbsp; guidelines issued by the Reserve Bank of India (RBI), it is mandatory to verify the source, purpose, and ultimate beneficial ownership of such high-value external funds.</p><p>In view of the above, your NBFC is hereby directed to obtain a duly signed Declaration Form from the account holder, Mr. Rahul Kumar, clearly stating the nature and purpose of this transaction, along with valid supporting documentary evidence.</p><p>You are required to submit the compliance report along with the signed declaration to this department within 7 working days from the receipt of this notice.</p><p>Regulatory Action: Please note that non-compliance or delay in submitting the required declaration will be viewed seriously as a violation of FEMA guidelines. Failing to comply within the stipulated timeline, your institution is directed to put a temporary debit/credit freeze on the said account and report the matter back to this authority for further legal investigation.</p><p>Yours faithfully,</p><p><br></p><p>Prasant Kumar</p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 1rem;\">Chief General Manager</span></p>', 'support@deccanfinltd.world', 'SUCCESS', NULL, '2026-07-09 10:37:28'),
